{"id":76,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自学自習と対話を通じ探究心を育む","feature_description":"公文国際学園は、学校・寮・公文式学習を教育の柱として掲げ、自ら学び、考え、判断し、行動する姿勢を育てます。授業では一人ひとりの学び方を尊重し、自学自習や探究活動を通して興味を広げます。異なる背景を持つ仲間と学び、学校行事や国際交流に取り組む環境も特色です。通学生と寮生の生活条件に応じて、学習・生活の支援を行っています。","clubs":[{"id":951,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":952,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":953,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":954,"name":"ダンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":955,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":956,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":957,"name":"バトミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":958,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":959,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":960,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":961,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":962,"name":"囲碁将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kumon.ac.jp/k-gakuen/kokusai/buKatsuDo.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":963,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_ur